{"4422260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hakoniwa Electric", "steam_appid": 4422260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/f268d5859e098b06591d634205c696a3.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hakoniwa Electric is a relaxing puzzle exploration game where you can unwind at your own pace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akari and her robot buddy Lamp take over grandpa's electronics shop while he's off vacationing in the tropics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/f634b66400011c31860e5fecb5b03678.avif?t=1786028936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras_big/f634b66400011c31860e5fecb5b03678.avif?t=1786028936 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip the breaker to light up the shop,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5b5c048abfde7032ccd01bd7b6cb81c2.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5b5c048abfde7032ccd01bd7b6cb81c2.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5b5c048abfde7032ccd01bd7b6cb81c2.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put up the job request poster, and you're good to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5f4159d6348e4be2ea2d4100ab5bfe1c.avif?t=1786028936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras_big/5f4159d6348e4be2ea2d4100ab5bfe1c.avif?t=1786028936 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the little everyday woes from the townsfolk, and enjoy watching the seasons roll by and the shop slowly come alive over the course of a year</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/2a6423a4127e821ef54d5d8e7fcd0d8a.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore small, charming worlds that capture the changing seasons, like little dioramas come to life.<br>Each stage is packed with delightful details just waiting for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/3904a384d41b9b78a7c5c486486ed3c1.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/3904a384d41b9b78a7c5c486486ed3c1.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/3904a384d41b9b78a7c5c486486ed3c1.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/456f42211e1e94780c905e3a9a513463.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage hides a puzzle. First, solve the breaker puzzle to light up the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it's bright, search for broken items. Click on objects that catch your eye, like a record player or a coffee maker, to find their hidden puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult calculations or tedious trial and error required. Simply enjoy the satisfying feeling of bringing things back to life, at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/7bbffe255a0b646ad315d2c54bbf16d1.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/7bbffe255a0b646ad315d2c54bbf16d1.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/7bbffe255a0b646ad315d2c54bbf16d1.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/8bbb80ebb0781a2b68d48b1dcb1677fd.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a stage, and Akari's &quot;Monthly Report&quot; updates with glimpses of her daily life. Peek in to see what she felt in that place and who she met...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/d405f1ec9186a1ec6d25d25842d4140f.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/d405f1ec9186a1ec6d25d25842d4140f.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/d405f1ec9186a1ec6d25d25842d4140f.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/48a9543b70fe21db74ea4afb5a29b3b3.webp?t=1786028936\" width=1200 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/9b90c57bcc0ddef7d04a0319e7af3a48.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, nostalgic stages that feel like a miniature garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult calculations, time limits, or harsh penalties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A healing experience you can enjoy at your own pace, whenever and however much you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The satisfying feeling of solving puzzles to repair and light up a miniature world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle year-long story woven by novice shopkeeper Akari and her partner, Lamp</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/f268d5859e098b06591d634205c696a3.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hakoniwa Electric is a relaxing puzzle exploration game where you can unwind at your own pace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akari and her robot buddy Lamp take over grandpa's electronics shop while he's off vacationing in the tropics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/f634b66400011c31860e5fecb5b03678.avif?t=1786028936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras_big/f634b66400011c31860e5fecb5b03678.avif?t=1786028936 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip the breaker to light up the shop,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5b5c048abfde7032ccd01bd7b6cb81c2.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5b5c048abfde7032ccd01bd7b6cb81c2.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5b5c048abfde7032ccd01bd7b6cb81c2.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put up the job request poster, and you're good to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/5f4159d6348e4be2ea2d4100ab5bfe1c.avif?t=1786028936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras_big/5f4159d6348e4be2ea2d4100ab5bfe1c.avif?t=1786028936 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the little everyday woes from the townsfolk, and enjoy watching the seasons roll by and the shop slowly come alive over the course of a year</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/2a6423a4127e821ef54d5d8e7fcd0d8a.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore small, charming worlds that capture the changing seasons, like little dioramas come to life.<br>Each stage is packed with delightful details just waiting for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/3904a384d41b9b78a7c5c486486ed3c1.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/3904a384d41b9b78a7c5c486486ed3c1.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/3904a384d41b9b78a7c5c486486ed3c1.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/456f42211e1e94780c905e3a9a513463.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage hides a puzzle. First, solve the breaker puzzle to light up the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it's bright, search for broken items. Click on objects that catch your eye, like a record player or a coffee maker, to find their hidden puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult calculations or tedious trial and error required. Simply enjoy the satisfying feeling of bringing things back to life, at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/7bbffe255a0b646ad315d2c54bbf16d1.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/7bbffe255a0b646ad315d2c54bbf16d1.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/7bbffe255a0b646ad315d2c54bbf16d1.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/8bbb80ebb0781a2b68d48b1dcb1677fd.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a stage, and Akari's &quot;Monthly Report&quot; updates with glimpses of her daily life. Peek in to see what she felt in that place and who she met...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/d405f1ec9186a1ec6d25d25842d4140f.poster.avif?t=1786028936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/d405f1ec9186a1ec6d25d25842d4140f.webm?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/d405f1ec9186a1ec6d25d25842d4140f.mp4?t=1786028936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/48a9543b70fe21db74ea4afb5a29b3b3.webp?t=1786028936\" width=1200 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/extras/9b90c57bcc0ddef7d04a0319e7af3a48.webp?t=1786028936\" width=902 height=51 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, nostalgic stages that feel like a miniature garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult calculations, time limits, or harsh penalties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A healing experience you can enjoy at your own pace, whenever and however much you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The satisfying feeling of solving puzzles to repair and light up a miniature world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle year-long story woven by novice shopkeeper Akari and her partner, Lamp</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "&quot;Hakoniwa Electric&quot; is a cute relaxing puzzle game. Explore adorable isometric stages, solve puzzles, and light them up. Why not spend a leisurely year as Akari, who's taken over grandpa's electronics shop, helping with the monthly troubles from the townsfolk?", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/c1d0d0623d601e13c7ad541c92e3b21d8223cdc5/header.jpg?t=1786028936", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/11ba0874851b7376348ebb23f92d89c2eeb40c95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786028936", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422260/11ba0874851b7376348ebb23f92d89c2eeb40c95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786028936", "website": "https://zzz-anettai.com/hakoniwaelectric", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["亜寝帯 - ANETTAI"], "publishers": ["亜寝帯 - ANETTAI"], "demos": [{"appid": 4569870, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thum